{"id":70081,"date":"2025-11-25T20:31:34","date_gmt":"2025-11-25T19:31:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70081"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:51:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:51:30","slug":"tracn4-elands-marathon","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/tracn4-elands-marathon\/","title":{"rendered":"TRACN4 Elands Marathon 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">TRACN4 Elands Marathon 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>TRACN4 Elands Marathon 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>27 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), na prov\u00edncia de <strong>Mpumalanga, \u00c1frica do Sul<\/strong>, com chegada unificada no <strong>Sappi Skills Training Centre (SSTC), em Ngodwana<\/strong> (931 m de altitude). Reconhecida como a maratona mais r\u00e1pida de Mpumalanga e uma das mais r\u00e1pidas da \u00c1frica do Sul, a prova serve como qualificat\u00f3ria oficial de excel\u00eancia para a Two Oceans Marathon e para a Comrades Marathon, decorrendo ao longo do pitoresco vale do Rio Elands na corredor rodovi\u00e1rio N4 (com encerramento total da via ao tr\u00e2nsito autom\u00f3vel a partir das 03:00).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa competitivo integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias homologadas sob as regras da Athletics South Africa (ASA), World Athletics e Athletics Mpumalanga (AMPU): a <strong>Maratona (42,2 km)<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>05:30<\/strong> na Laerskool Oosterlijn em eMgwenya (Waterval Boven, a 1 468 m de altitude, num tra\u00e7ado ponto a ponto com 343 m D+ e 874 m D\u2212, declive m\u00e9dio de \u22122,7% e passagem pelo famoso T\u00fanel de Waterval Boven); a <strong>Meia Maratona (21,1 km)<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>06:00<\/strong> junto ao Malaga Hotel na N4; e a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong>, com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>06:30<\/strong> em Ngodwana SSTC num percurso plano pelos terrenos da Sappi Ngodwana Cattle Farm.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Nedbank Mpumalanga LVCC Running Club<\/strong> com o patroc\u00ednio principal da <strong>Trans African Concessions (TRAC)<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o garante postos de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o a cada 3 km, transporte oficial de autocarro para os pontos de partida dos 42,2 km e 21,1 km (entre as 03:00 e as 04:30 a partir de Ngodwana SSTC), medalha oficial para todos os finalistas dentro do tempo limite (encerramento da meta \u00e0s 11:30) e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os primeiros classificados.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Mpumalanga, \u00c1frica do Sul<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"